  <monstergroupinfo>
    <monstergrouptitle>The Masquerade</monstergrouptitle>
    <monstergroupid>masquerade</monstergroupid>
    <monstergroupdescription>
      <p>
	They walk among us.  The masquerade are fell lizard folk
	who live amongst us and sadistically plot our downfall.
	The call themselves the Herpeton and resent the hegemenony
	of the hot-bloods.
      </p>

      <p>
	There are many types of vampires who form different courts.
	Chief amongst these are the Black Court,
	the Red Court, the White Court and the Jade Court. 
      </p>
      
    </monstergroupdescription>
  </monstergroupinfo>

  
